<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse, Zurich says it has issued five million European-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	21.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  $707.00</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	    700.0	 8.72 SFR	 9.44 PCT     10.12 X</p>
<p> PUT	     675.0	 3.90 SFR	 8.40 PCT     22.65 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
